### Get reviews
GET http://localhost:8080/reviews

### Create Review
POST http://localhost:8080/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description":"wonderful service!!!",
  "rating": 9,
  "reviewer": {
    "id": 32
  },
  "provider": {
    "id": 31
  }
}

### Update Review
PUT http://localhost:8080/reviews/5
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description":"perfect service!!!",
  "rating": 10,
  "reviewer": {
    "id": 32,
    "name": "Robert Reviewer1"
  },
  "provider": {
    "id": 31,
    "name": "Robert Provider1"
  }
}

### Delete review
DELETE http://localhost:8080/reviews
